---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import Chip from '../Chip.astro';
import { team } from '../../data/team';
import { langOf, useT } from '../../i18n';

const t = useT(Astro);
---

<section class="team">
	<div class="intro">
		<Chip>Team</Chip>
		<h2 class="t-h2">{t('Salam Kenal dari SriRona!', 'Hello from SriRona!')}</h2>
		{langOf(Astro) === 'en' ? (
			<>
				<p class="t-body-l">
					We are a creative collective that grew out of curiosity and experience in design and strategic communication. We believe
					the best digital products don't rely on technology alone to reach their goals; they also have to touch the human side of
					the people who use them.
				</p>
				<p class="t-body-l">
					Our core team is lean. But we work alongside specialists across industries, such as trusted developers, researchers,
					illustrators, and writers. For us, the best solutions come from an open exchange of ideas, not from one rigid desk.
				</p>
				<p class="t-body-l">
					Working remotely from Bandung, Tangerang, and Yogyakarta, we're open to working with founders, marketers, and
					organizations who are starting something new, growing a business, or simply looking for direction. Let's take some time
					for a relaxed chat about products and design. <strong>No demands, no pressure</strong>.
				</p>
			</>
		) : (
			<>
				<p class="t-body-l">
					Kami adalah studio kreatif kolektif yang tumbuh dari rasa ingin tahu serta pengalaman di ranah desain dan komunikasi strategis.
					Kami percaya bahwa produk digital terbaik tidak hanya mengandalkan teknologi untuk mencapai tujuan, tetapi juga harus mampu
					menyentuh sisi manusiawi penggunanya.
				</p>
				<p class="t-body-l">
					Tim inti kami memang ramping. Namun, kami bersinergi dengan para spesialis lintas industri: seperti developer, researcher,
					ilustrator, dan penulis terpercaya. Karena bagi kami, solusi terbaik lahir dari pertukaran pikiran yang terbuka, bukan dari satu
					meja kerja yang kaku.
				</p>
				<p class="t-body-l">
					Bekerja secara remote dari Bandung, Tangerang, dan Yogyakarta, kami membuka ruang kerja sama bagi para pendiri bisnis, marketer,
					maupun organisasi yang sedang merintis hal baru, mengembangkan bisnis, atau sekadar mencari arah. Mari luangkan waktu untuk
					mengobrol santai seputar produk dan desain. <strong>Tanpa tuntutan, tanpa tekanan</strong>.
				</p>
			</>
		)}
	</div>
	<ul class="members">
		{
			team.map(({ name, role, photo, bio, bioEn }) => (
				<li>
					<Image class="photo" src={photo} alt={name} width={286} />
					<h3 class="t-subtitle-m">
						<span>{name}</span>
						<span class="dash"> - </span>
						<span>{role}</span>
					</h3>
					<p class="t-body-l">{t(bio, bioEn)}</p>
				</li>
			))
		}
	</ul>
</section>

<style>
	.team {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 36px;
		padding: 100px 0;
		--chip-bg: var(--primary-02);
	}
	.intro {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		align-items: flex-start;
		gap: 24px;
		width: 100%;
		max-width: 1000px;
		text-wrap: balance;
	}
	.intro h2 {
		text-wrap: wrap;
	}
	.members {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 500px));
		gap: 36px 24px;
		width: 100%;
		padding: 0 200px;
	}
	.members li {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		align-items: flex-start;
		gap: 24px;
		text-wrap: balance;
	}
	.photo {
		width: 143px;
		height: auto;
		aspect-ratio: 0.713158;
		border-radius: 24px;
		object-fit: cover;
	}
	.members h3 {
		max-width: 450px;
	}
	.members p {
		max-width: 400px;
	}

	@media (max-width: 1199px) {
		.team {
			padding: 100px 40px;
		}
		.intro p {
			max-width: 700px;
		}
		.members {
			grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 350px));
			column-gap: 32px;
			padding: 0;
		}
		/* Tablet puts name and role on separate lines. */
		.members h3 span {
			display: block;
		}
		.members h3 .dash {
			display: none;
		}
		.members h3 span:last-child {
			margin-top: 24px;
		}
	}

	@media (max-width: 809px) {
		.team {
			padding: 60px 20px;
		}
		.members {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
		}
		.members h3 span,
		.members h3 .dash {
			display: inline;
		}
		.members h3 span:last-child {
			margin-top: 0;
		}
		.intro p,
		.members p {
			max-width: 349px;
		}
		.members h3 {
			max-width: 349px;
		}
	}
</style>
